# Plan data for tests/modules/upgrade/test_plan_render.sh - a follow with every gap kind.
#
# One gap of each of the five states, written in an order that is not the order the plan is
# allowed to print, so the sort is asserted rather than assumed. The custom-feed URL is
# deliberately longer than any width the plan renders at: it is the one thing on the block
# that cannot be folded.
